# Root environment (monorepo local development)

Copy to `.env` and fill in values locally. **Never commit real secrets.**

# Public API URL for clients and examples (default local API port)
CRYPRICE_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Optional demo API key (not required for local development)
# CRYPRICE_PUBLIC_API_KEY=

# CORS (API service — see services/api/.env.example for full list)
# Production example:
# CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://app.cryprice.dev,https://cryprice.dev
